{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":4},"En toute liberté - Une radio pour la paix","Au nord de l’Irak, sept jeunes journalistes, musulmans, chrétiens et yézidis, tendent leurs micros à ceux qui veulent la paix. Ils travaillent pour Radio Al-Salam, antenne affranchie d’influences politiques et religieuses. En toute liberté, des voix s’élèvent sur les ondes et font renaître le lien au sein d’une nation.",[],{"type":5,"id":6,"slug":7,"title":8,"release":10,"filmType":14,"directors":15,"genre":24,"media":27,"synopsis":30,"production":31,"characters":34,"roles":35,"awards":40,"tags":3},"Film","FR2023_060","fr2023-060-en-toute-liberte-une-radio-pour-la-paix",{"native":1,"english":9},"",{"type":11,"date":12,"year":13},"Theatrical release","2023-03-08",2023,"Documentary",[16],{"id":17,"slug":18,"name":17,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":23},"Xavier de Lauzanne","xavier-de-lauzanne",1970,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[25,26],"Documentary – Observational mode","Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":28,"trailerUrl":29},"https://medias.unifrance.org/medias/244/251/261108/format_page/en-toute-liberte-une-radio-pour-la-paix.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SvSe1t7o4X8",{"native":2,"english":9},[32],{"country":22,"share":33},"Majority coproducer",[],[36],{"person":37,"role":39},{"id":17,"slug":18,"name":17,"birthYear":19,"deathYear":20,"gender":21,"nationality":22,"awards":38},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
